        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises RPD-250, Solid Brass 2-1/2 Drop Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2-1/2 Inch Drop Ring Pull is a wonderfully, retro pull that can be used on almost any lightweight drawer or door. The Solid Brass 2-1/2 Drop Ring Pull can be used as either a cabinet pull or as a handle on furniture like dressers and bedside tables so you can customize the look of any piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/1-1-2-inch-drop-ring-pull-field-enterprises-rpd-150\">Small Drop Finger Ring Pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Drop RPD250 Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
